"105600": "Dig, fight, explore, build! Nothing is impossible in this action-packed adventure game. Four Pack also available!",
"252490": "The only aim in Rust is to survive. Everything wants you to die - the island’s wildlife, other inhabitants, the environment, and other survivors. Do whatever it takes to last another night.",
