"582010": "Welcome to a new world! In Monster Hunter: World, the latest installment in the series, you can enjoy the ultimate hunting experience, using everything at your disposal to hunt monsters in a new world teeming with surprises and excitement.",
"391540": "UNDERTALE! The RPG game where you don't have to destroy anyone.",
