"200260": "Get Batman: Arkham City and all DLC for one low price with the release of the GOTY Edition!",
"50300": "A Third-Person modern military Shooter designed to challenge players' morality by putting them in the middle of unspeakable situations.",
"1089980": "A choose-your-own-path where failing is more fun than succeeding.",
"813820": "Join 20+ million players and experience a new kind of battle royale in Realm Royale Reforged! Choose your class, forge deadly weapons, and master powerful abilities to be the last champion standing. Mount up alone or with a team to explore a fantasy world while outrunning the deadly fog.",
